  displayName: Orc
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4cec69850a1a35e41a43e11ed5ff963f, type: 3}
  description: Orcs are stocky, muscular greenskins of medium human size, broad-shouldered
    and brutish but not gigantic. They are striding on two powerful legs with a solid,
    steady walking pace rather than goblin-like scampering. Orcs bark orders and
    battle cries in coarse speech, their guttural voices carrying across camps and
    warbands.
